      "content": "It is completely understandable that \"crisis\" feels like a dismissive word when you are experiencing such a fundamental death of self and life as you describe. If the self you *knew* is gone, the focus right now should not be on \"rebuilding a self,\" but on self-compassion for the self that is struggling to survive the loss. Please tell a professional how final this feels, as they can help you navigate this deep, life-altering void that you are in right now.",
